+        // Each locked buffer holds exactly indexCount + prevOnlyIndexCount
+        // indices, and the three fill passes below advance a raw pointer per
+        // submesh with no bound of their own. The asserts expressing that
+        // invariant are compiled out of release builds, so a mesh whose
